AIOHD NEXT 3.2.1-r1 (2026-09-14)
- Rebuilt ChannelSelection right panel: smaller 16:9 MiniTV and more room for EPG.
- Multi-line FullDescription with vertical auto-scroll when the text does not fit.
- Four upcoming events retained in a cleaner right-panel layout.
- Channel names increased to 38/42 px in NextBold; strong active-row selection retained.
- InfoBar reduced to 240 px and reorganized around current event, progress and next event.
- Full long EPG description remains in the scrollable Event Information screen.
- Inline weather added: city, temperature, condition and icon.
- OpenATV Weather Plugin is the preferred inline data provider when installed/configured.
- Other installed weather plugins remain selectable as launchers.
- Visible skin version unified as 3.2.1; IPK package revision is r1.

AIOHD NEXT 3.2.1-r0 (2026-09-14)
- Fixed weather-plugin discovery for OpenATV PluginDescriptor.function.
- Added main-menu launcher discovery and manual all-plugin selection.
- Bold channel names 36/40 px and event text 30/32 px.
- 15/14 rows in one-line mode and 9/8 in two-line mode.
- Font settings survive later setFontsize calls.
- Bootlogo updated to 3.2.1 and copied to the system bootlogo only when AIOHD is active.

AIOHD NEXT 3.2.0-r0 (2026-09-14)
- Larger channel-list typography and optional extra-large mode.
- Local row-height handling without global ServiceList changes.
- Stronger active-row selection for Aurora, Amber and Violet.
- Weather-plugin launcher selection in AIOHD NEXT Style.
- MiniTV and four upcoming events retained.
- Full source tree, IPK builder, tests and GitHub Actions.

AIOHD NEXT 3.1.3-r0 (2026-09-13)
- EventView/InfoBarEventView layer fixes and scrollable EPG description.
- Improved MessageBox sizing/paging, InfoBar readability and shared ChannelSelection layout.
- One-query upcoming EPG with chronological filtering, deduplication and bounded cache.
- Explicit progress/selection colours and assorted OpenATV screen fixes.
- Removed precompiled Python cache from the all-architecture package.

AIOHD NEXT 3.1.2-r0
- Added solid background layers to remove TV bleed-through.
- Repaired Event Information description rendering.
- Minor visual cleanup and version bump.
